# Chats

## Presenting a set

When a chat message presents a set of items (anything the reader must weigh as a group) structure it so the set reads clearly and stays visually distinct from surrounding prose.

## Questions vs. instructions

A question is not a command. Answer it; don't act on it unless asked.
